fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"Release-notes-for-1-13-0.html#added-support-for-the-qnx-qccq-compiler-driver","fragment":"Added support for the QNX qcc/q++ compiler driver\nMeson can now detect and use qcc and q++, the C and C++ compiler drivers shipped with the\nQNX Software Development Platform (SDP), and recognizes QNX as a target platform.  See\nPlatform notes for cross compilation setup and known limitations.\n"});